This installs @PRODUCT_NAME@ @VERSION@ for macOS @MIN_MACOS@ or later (Apple silicon and Intel).

Choose the plug-in formats on the next pages:

  VST3        /Library/Audio/Plug-Ins/VST3/@PRODUCT_NAME@.vst3
  Audio Unit  /Library/Audio/Plug-Ins/Components/@PRODUCT_NAME@.component

Quit your DAW before continuing. If a host does not list the Audio Unit after installing,
open a Terminal and run:  killall -9 AudioComponentRegistrar

@VENDOR_URL@
